VIM
===

Powerful text editor.


BASIC
-----
vim file.txt

Opens file in Vim.


MODES
-----
Normal mode     Move, delete, copy
Insert mode     Type text
Command mode    Save, exit, search


SWITCH MODES
------------
i               Enter insert mode
Esc             Exit to normal mode
:               Enter command mode


BASIC COMMANDS
---------------
h j k l         Move left/down/up/right
dd              Delete line
yy              Copy line
p               Paste
u               Undo
Ctrl+R          Redo


SAVE & EXIT
-----------
:w              Save
:q              Quit
:wq             Save & quit
:q!             Quit without save


SEARCH
------
/text           Search for text
n               Next match
N               Previous match


INSERT TEXT
-----------
i               Insert before cursor
a               Insert after cursor
o               New line below
O               New line above


TIPS
----
Vim has a steep learning curve.
Try nano first as beginner.
Type :help inside Vim for help.
